<div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Anonymous_or_pseudonymous_works" data-mw-thread-id="h-Anonymous_or_pseudonymous_works-Terms"><span data-mw-comment-start="" id="h-Anonymous_or_pseudonymous_works-Terms"></span>Anonymous or pseudonymous works<span data-mw-comment-end="h-Anonymous_or_pseudonymous_works-Terms"></span></h3></div>
<p><span id="Anonymous_or_Pseudonymous_works"></span>
</p><p>If the author of the work is unveiled during its copyright term, it is protected as an individual work. e.g. Osamu Tezuka (手塚 治, died in 1989) and his pen name "手塚 治虫" are well-known among people, so his works will be protected in Japan until 2059.
</p>
