<td style="background-color: #F0F8FF;"><a href="/wiki/Template:PD-Japan-organization" title="Template:PD-Japan-organization"><span style="font-family:monospace,monospace;">{{PD-Japan-organization}}</span></a><br><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r360851041"><span class="monospaced">{{<a href="/wiki/Template:PD-1996" title="Template:PD-1996">PD-1996</a>|country=Japan}}</span>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<th>within 50 years<br>before the publication year
</th>
<td style="background-color: #FFF0F0;">The work is still protected under Japanese law.
</td></tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan="3">1 January 1978 –
</th>
<th>– 31 December 1927
</th>
<td><a href="/wiki/Template:PD-Japan-organization" title="Template:PD-Japan-organization"><span style="font-family:monospace,monospace;">{{PD-Japan-organization}}</span></a> but US <a href="/wiki/Special:MyLanguage/Commons:Subsisting_copyright" title="Special:MyLanguage/Commons:Subsisting copyright">subsisting copyright</a> may continue. See <a href="/wiki/Special:MyLanguage/Commons:Hirtle_chart" title="Special:MyLanguage/Commons:Hirtle chart">Commons:Hirtle chart</a>.
</td></tr>
<tr>
<th>more than 50 years<br>before the publication year
</th>
<td><a href="/wiki/Template:PD-Japan-organization" title="Template:PD-Japan-organization"><span style="font-family:monospace,monospace;">{{PD-Japan-organization}}</span></a> but US <a href="/wiki/Special:MyLanguage/Commons:Subsisting_copyright" title="Special:MyLanguage/Commons:Subsisting copyright">subsisting copyright</a> may continue. See <a href="/wiki/Special:MyLanguage/Commons:Hirtle_chart" title="Special:MyLanguage/Commons:Hirtle chart">Commons:Hirtle chart</a>.
</td></tr>
<tr>
<th>within 50 years<br>before the publication year
</th>
<td style="background-color: #FFF0F0;">The work is still protected under Japanese law.
</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p><br>
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Old_photographs" data-mw-thread-id="h-Old_photographs-Terms"><span data-mw-comment-start="" id="h-Old_photographs-Terms"></span>Old photographs<span data-mw-comment-end="h-Old_photographs-Terms"></span></h3></div>
<p>This table applies to photographs <b>taken on or before December 31, 1957</b>. Photographs taken after that date should be evaluated under the Copyright Act of 1970.
</p>
