<p>The work is not acceptable in Commons because of <a href="/wiki/Special:MyLanguage/COM:URAA" title="Special:MyLanguage/COM:URAA">URAA restoration</a>, as it was still under copyright in Japan on January 1, 1996, based on the pre-2018 copyright term of 50 years p.m.a. Note that <a href="/wiki/Template:Not-PD-US-URAA" title="Template:Not-PD-US-URAA"><span style="font-family:monospace,monospace;">{{Not-PD-US-URAA}}</span></a> may be used for files uploaded before 1 March 2012.
</p>
</td></tr>
