</td></tr>
<tr>
<th>1 January 1931 – <br>31 December 1955
</th>
<td><a href="/wiki/Template:PD-Japan-film" title="Template:PD-Japan-film"><span style="font-family:monospace,monospace;">{{PD-Japan-film}}</span></a><br>
<p>The work is not acceptable on Commons because of <a href="/wiki/Special:MyLanguage/COM:URAA" title="Special:MyLanguage/COM:URAA">URAA restoration</a>, as it was still under copyright in Japan on January 1, 1996, being within 38 years of the death of the last surviving author for cinematographic works made public before 1971.<span style="color:gray;font-size:80%;"><sup>[1899 Art. 3]</sup></span><span style="color:gray;font-size:80%;"><sup>[1970 Supp. Art. 7]</sup></span> Note that <a href="/wiki/Template:Not-PD-US-URAA" title="Template:Not-PD-US-URAA"><span style="font-family:monospace,monospace;">{{Not-PD-US-URAA}}</span></a> may be used only for files uploaded before 1 March 2012.
